{%- comment -%}
  Loads the compiled theme bundle.

  Hand-written and deliberately static, rather than rendering the generated
  snippets/vite-tag.liquid. vite-plugin-shopify rewrites that file to point at
  http://localhost:5173 whenever the Vite dev server is running, and because
  `shopify theme dev` syncs it straight to the store, every HTTPS context — the
  theme editor, any preview link — blocked those URLs as mixed content and
  rendered the page with no CSS at all.

  Nothing here is generated, so nothing here can go stale or point at localhost.
  Filenames are unhashed by design; see the note in vite.config.js.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'theme.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'theme.js' | asset_url }}" type="module" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
